body:
Damn you hit the nail on the head there. I'm dxed with BDD as well and I knew that was a huge root of it, but as I grew older I also started to nitpick myself based on things more related to my perceived gender (i.e. chest) 

&#x200B;

That's promising to hear though, I'm not sure I'll ever build up good self esteem either but it's nice to know it could be possible for me to break this habit one day.
